{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512480/extras/83c30dde74f6bf2d0aa588db465ef632.poster.avif?t=1761936439\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512480/extras/83c30dde74f6bf2d0aa588db465ef632.webm?t=1761936439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512480/extras/83c30dde74f6bf2d0aa588db465ef632.mp4?t=1761936439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When the world drowned, only the light remained</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a cataclysm that swallowed continents and erased civilization, a handful of survivors discover a solitary lighthouse standing above the endless ocean. Around its glow, humanity makes its last stand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are their leader, the one who must rebuild, protect, and guide the final city of humankind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Lighthouse: The Heart of Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your lighthouse is more than a beacon. It\u2019s life itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Keep the Flame Alive</strong> \u2013 Generate power, gather fuel, and manage what little remains of the old world. If the light dies, people vanish into the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udd39 <strong>A Beacon for the Lost</strong> \u2013 The light draws drifters from across the sea. Each new survivor brings labor, stories, and hope, but also new mouths to feed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udd39 <strong>Guard the Light, Fear the Depths</strong> \u2013 The ocean hides ancient secrets and unknown dangers waiting beyond the beam\u2019s reach.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Unforgiving Ocean</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512480/extras/37f6b65c8ab6463afe15162d39321123.poster.avif?t=1761936439\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512480/extras/37f6b65c8ab6463afe15162d39321123.webm?t=1761936439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512480/extras/37f6b65c8ab6463afe15162d39321123.mp4?t=1761936439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26ab <strong>The Darkness</strong> \u2013 The lighthouse must never fail, or you risk losing people to an unseen force that lurks beyond the light.<br>\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Unforgiving Weather</strong> \u2013 Face devastating storms that tear apart your structures and dead calms that starve your city of resources.<br>\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Resource Scarcity</strong> \u2013 Manage food, energy, and morale as supplies dwindle and the sea grows more hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2696 <strong>Choices That Shape Humanity</strong> \u2013 Decide who to save, who to sacrifice, and what kind of world is worth rebuilding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7 <strong>Radial City-Building</strong> \u2013 Expand your city outward from the lighthouse, constructing and optimizing structures in a dynamic, ever-growing settlement.<br>\u2696 <strong>Moral Dilemmas</strong> \u2013 Survivors will come to you with desperate requests. Deny too many, and your rule will collapse. How far will you go to maintain order?<br>\u23f3 <strong>Constant Tension</strong> \u2013 Keep the lighthouse running, manage limited resources, and adapt to the ever-changing oceanic environment\u2014your survival depends on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sea remembers.<br>The light flickers.<br>And somewhere in the deep, something stirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you lead humanity\u2019s last city or watch it drown beneath the waves?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3512480?t=1761936439","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3512480?t=1761936439","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512480/af45ef00ab0a48adcaed954d470a1e8a3926e50b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761936439","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512480/af45ef00ab0a48adcaed954d470a1e8a3926e50b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761936439","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Mature Content"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512480/extras/83c30dde74f6bf2d0aa588db465ef632.poster.avif?t=1761936439\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512480/extras/83c30dde74f6bf2d0aa588db465ef632.webm?t=1761936439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512480/extras/83c30dde74f6bf2d0aa588db465ef632.mp4?t=1761936439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When the world drowned, only the light remained</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a cataclysm that swallowed continents and erased civilization, a handful of survivors discover a solitary lighthouse standing above the endless ocean. Around its glow, humanity makes its last stand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are their leader, the one who must rebuild, protect, and guide the final city of humankind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Lighthouse: The Heart of Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your lighthouse is more than a beacon. It\u2019s life itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Keep the Flame Alive</strong> \u2013 Generate power, gather fuel, and manage what little remains of the old world. If the light dies, people vanish into the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udd39 <strong>A Beacon for the Lost</strong> \u2013 The light draws drifters from across the sea. Each new survivor brings labor, stories, and hope, but also new mouths to feed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udd39 <strong>Guard the Light, Fear the Depths</strong> \u2013 The ocean hides ancient secrets and unknown dangers waiting beyond the beam\u2019s reach.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Unforgiving Ocean</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512480/extras/37f6b65c8ab6463afe15162d39321123.poster.avif?t=1761936439\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512480/extras/37f6b65c8ab6463afe15162d39321123.webm?t=1761936439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512480/extras/37f6b65c8ab6463afe15162d39321123.mp4?t=1761936439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26ab <strong>The Darkness</strong> \u2013 The lighthouse must never fail, or you risk losing people to an unseen force that lurks beyond the light.<br>\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Unforgiving Weather</strong> \u2013 Face devastating storms that tear apart your structures and dead calms that starve your city of resources.<br>\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Resource Scarcity</strong> \u2013 Manage food, energy, and morale as supplies dwindle and the sea grows more hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2696 <strong>Choices That Shape Humanity</strong> \u2013 Decide who to save, who to sacrifice, and what kind of world is worth rebuilding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7 <strong>Radial City-Building</strong> \u2013 Expand your city outward from the lighthouse, constructing and optimizing structures in a dynamic, ever-growing settlement.<br>\u2696 <strong>Moral Dilemmas</strong> \u2013 Survivors will come to you with desperate requests. Deny too many, and your rule will collapse. How far will you go to maintain order?<br>\u23f3 <strong>Constant Tension</strong> \u2013 Keep the lighthouse running, manage limited resources, and adapt to the ever-changing oceanic environment\u2014your survival depends on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sea remembers.<br>The light flickers.<br>And somewhere in the deep, something stirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you lead humanity\u2019s last city or watch it drown beneath the waves?</strong></p>","developers":["Fathomlight"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512480/f5167bedfab6606d0d3da05ba56bc3302fa93f71/header.jpg?t=1761936439","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3512480/830078/3ded773be2e692123bab194903b2685b83791e43/1750857184/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758095704","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3512480/830078/3ded773be2e692123bab194903b2685b83791e43/1750857184/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758095704","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3512480/830078/3ded773be2e692123bab19490